      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T21:29:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Most of the instances of this bug have very old messages (\u003e1 year old) present. \n\nI mostly chose one year because it seemed very safe (I didn\u0027t want to cause any regressions), with intention to monitor and reduce if issue still reproduced.\n\nI could change it to something like one month if you\u0027d prefer?",
